      "course_description": "Illinois Tech’s Interprofessional Projects (IPRO) Program is piloting a new “Studio” model designed to enhance interdisciplinary learning, career preparedness, and collaboration between students, faculty, and industry partners. This pilot, launching in Spring 2026 brings together multiple IPRO sections working on independent projects connected by a shared theme: creating a more sustainable future. Within the Studio, students will engage in unified educational experiences aligned with IPRO’s four core learning objectives through common lectures, industry seminars, and shared online materials. These sessions provide a consistent framework for developing teamwork, communication, ethics, and applied problem-solving skills while fostering connections to real-world sustainability challenges across disciplines.",
